    "expression_latex": "R_T \\le \\left( C_0\\beta^{-1} b + C_1(1 + \\upsilon)^{\\frac{1}{1 + \\epsilon}} \\log(|\\calA| T \\log^2 T)^{\\frac{\\epsilon}{1 + \\epsilon}} \\right) M^*_{1 + \\epsilon}(\\calA, T^{\\frac{-2\\epsilon}{1 + \\epsilon}}, \\beta)^{\\frac{1}{1 + \\epsilon}} T^{\\frac{1}{1 + \\epsilon}}",
