    "C_1": "unspecified constant",
    "beta_reg": "regularization weight beta >= 0 in the design objective M_{1+eps}",
    "M_star": "M*_{1+eps}(A, T^{-2eps/(1+eps)}, beta) = max_{V subset A} min_{lambda} M_{1+eps}(lambda; V, gamma, beta), action-set-dependent design complexity"
